parts.text:
Apply CSS changes. Need also maybe add arrow icon to trend? The markup has no arrow, so just color. Fine.

CSS `.stat-trend.is-down`:
```
.stat-trend.is-down {
  background: var(--coral-soft);
  color: #b34138;
}
```
Payment alert:
```
.admin-payment-alert.is-success { background: var(--mint-soft); color: #1e7b5f; }
.admin-payment-alert.is-danger { background: var(--coral-soft); color: #a63830; }
```
Potential `.admin-payment-alert .icon` inherits color. fine.

Verify actions:
```
.verify-actions {
  grid-column: 2 / -1;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  margin-top: 0;
}
```
But at mobile .verify-actions media sets `grid-column: 1 / -1; margin-top: 2px;` and retains justify-content:flex-end. Fine.

Need maybe payment verification card action row placement screenshot after. Good.

Patch QA script. Use edit.

